 "offset_seconds": -2.2200000000002085,
 "words_heard": 227,
 "words": 227,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The city walls lay broken and the gates were black with flame",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I sat among the ashes and I could not speak his name",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I tasted only wormwood and I swallowed only gall",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul remembered every wound and sank beneath it all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet this I call to mind",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And therefore I have hope",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD's acts of mercy never cease",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His compassions never come to an end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are new every morning",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Great is your faithfulness",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is my portion, says my soul",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Therefore I will hope in him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The grey light finds the window and the dark begins to fade",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The night that I was dreading is a night that he has made",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I did not earn the morning and I could not pay the cost",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But mercy came to find me in the places I had lost",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet this I call to mind",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And therefore I have hope",
